WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:05.260
I just realized I love Game of Thrones and
I hate spoilers, yet here I am reading a script

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:07.280
for season 6 game of thrones spoilers.

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:09.240
I need to re-evaluate my life choices.

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:11.650
Ready for some Game of Thrones season six
spoilers?

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:13.450
“You know nothing…

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:14.650
Jon Snow.”

00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:17.060
No, well too bad.

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:21.410
The season finale confirmed the long-held
fan theory that Jon Snow has Targaryen blood.

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:25.380
Now, the big questions looming over the newly
crowned King in the North are if, when, and

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:30.439
how he and his biological aunt, Daenerys Targaryen,
will learn about their connection, and if

00:00:30.439 --> 00:00:31.910
makes them friends...or foes.

00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:35.739
But could Dany's trusty sidekick be the one
to ultimately bring the family together?

00:00:35.739 --> 00:00:39.719
Here's how Jorah Mormont will unite Daenerys
and Jon Snow in Game of Thrones...

00:00:39.719 --> 00:00:41.949
Shades of Greyscale

00:00:41.949 --> 00:00:45.699
The last glimpse we got of Jorah came when
Daenerys sent him away on horseback to find

00:00:45.699 --> 00:00:47.469
a cure for his case of Greyscale.

00:00:47.469 --> 00:00:51.729
Thanks to Princess Shireen Baratheon, we know
that a cure must exist for the disease, since

00:00:51.729 --> 00:00:53.679
she had it as a baby and was healed.

00:00:53.679 --> 00:00:57.839
Details on who or what saved her back then
aren't clear, but Jorah is resourceful enough

00:00:57.839 --> 00:00:58.839
to find out.

00:00:58.839 --> 00:00:59.989
Well, let’s hope so.

00:00:59.989 --> 00:01:03.979
Maybe he'll return to Qarth and consult with
Quaithe, the mysterious, masked shadowbinder

00:01:03.979 --> 00:01:06.970
who's both a prophet and good with protective
body paint.

00:01:06.970 --> 00:01:10.600
She's one of the characters missing from Season
6, and she's due for a comeback.

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:14.830
Or perhaps Ser Jorah will run into Melisandre
the Red Witch and strike a deal–after all,

00:01:14.830 --> 00:01:18.540
she's a free agent now, and a place in Dany's
kingdom would likely be a welcome opportunity.

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:21.000
I mean, she’s welcome to my kingdom at least
anytime.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:24.940
I don’t enven care if she is old and stuff,
wait I do.

00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:26.500
Family reunion

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:30.280
Fans loved meeting Lady Lyanna Mormont, the
pint-sized leader of Bear Island.

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:34.130
Her voice bends the will of even the toughest
leaders in the North, and she helped Jon Snow

00:01:34.130 --> 00:01:35.540
claim his throne at Winterfell.

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:36.920
“I don’t care if he is a bastard.

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:39.100
Ned Stark’s blood runs through his veins.

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:44.160
He’s my king from this day until his last
day.”

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:46.690
She also just so happens to be Jorah's first
cousin.

00:01:46.690 --> 00:01:50.590
The former Lord of Bear Island has kept away
from his home since being exiled, but maybe

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:54.659
it's time to return home and atone for his
crimes, starting with a visit to Lady Lyanna

00:01:54.659 --> 00:01:56.120
so he can plead for mercy.

00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:59.960
That rekindled connection with Lyanna would
certainly get the ball rolling on introducing

00:01:59.960 --> 00:02:02.340
his Queen to the King in the North.

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:03.670
Dragon lover

00:02:03.670 --> 00:02:07.850
Now that she's left her lover Daario Naharis
to babysit the people of Meereen, Daenerys

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:09.440
is single—and ready to mingle.

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:11.209
“Does that mean you are now eligible.”

00:02:11.209 --> 00:02:12.620
“Yes, I am eligible.

00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:14.830
I’m single and I want to mingle.”

00:02:14.830 --> 00:02:18.719
Jorah, meanwhile, has admitted his true feelings
for her:

00:02:18.719 --> 00:02:23.340
“I love you.

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:28.049
I will always love you.”

00:02:28.049 --> 00:02:29.109
Awkward.

00:02:29.109 --> 00:02:33.709
Daenerys has already indicated that she plans
to make her next marriage a strategic one

00:02:33.709 --> 00:02:36.859
that helps unite her with her one true love:
the Iron Throne.

00:02:36.859 --> 00:02:38.299
So romantic...

00:02:38.299 --> 00:02:41.540
Given the potential of the Mormont name to
help secure her audience with key leaders

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:45.609
in the North, a marriage could fulfill both
their hearts' desires and be good for politics.

00:02:45.609 --> 00:02:47.370
Hey it could happen!

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:49.590
A Song of Ice and Fire

00:02:49.590 --> 00:02:54.220
Let's not forget that Daenerys isn't the only
Targaryen who needs allies for the war ahead.

00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:58.220
After all, winter has finally come to the
North, and the Night King could bring it everywhere

00:02:58.220 --> 00:02:59.220
else.

00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:03.200
Dany's fire-breathing dragons could be just
what Snow needs to defeat the icy undead.

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:05.230
“Dracarus.”

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:11.840
Plus, Dany already has an old friend of Jon's
on board: Theon Greyjoy.

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:16.510
Jorah, with the influence of Lyanna and possibly
even Davos Seaworth, could finally bring the

00:03:16.510 --> 00:03:20.269
Targaryen family together again to sing their
song of ice and fire.

00:03:20.269 --> 00:03:21.500
Thanks for watching!

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:24.700
Subscribe to our YouTube channel to watch
more videos like the one you just saw.

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:28.079
And leave us a comment to let us know what
role you think Ser Jorah will play...

